WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.570
A respected doctor drinks
from a fizzing glass.

2
00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:07.560
He feels younger, lighter,
and suddenly smaller.

3
00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:09.690
There's no mirror in that room.

4
00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:13.760
So he creeps through the sleeping
house to his bedroom glass.

5
00:00:13.810 --> 00:00:15.640
A stranger looks back.

6
00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:19.140
Later, he writes down what
he felt in that moment.

7
00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:20.660
Read it carefully.

8
00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:23.560
So did the potion create a monster?

9
00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:27.430
Or was Hyde there,
inside Jekyll, all along?

10
00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:31.730
In this mission, you'll discover that
Jekyll was living "a profound duplicity

11
00:00:31.780 --> 00:00:34.580
of life" long before any potion.

12
00:00:34.630 --> 00:00:37.110
You'll read his first sight
of Hyde in the mirror,

13
00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:38.850
phrase by phrase.

14
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:41.240
And you'll weigh two ways of reading Hyde,

15
00:00:41.290 --> 00:00:43.860
remembering who is telling this story.

16
00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:47.470
Your mission: decide whether
Hyde is a new monster,

17
00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:49.180
or Jekyll all along.
